<main class="home">
  <section class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Co-op defense</p>
    <h1>Last Keep</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Hold the keep. Build between waves. Fifteen heroes, one stockpile, no end to the dark.
    </p>
  </section>

  <form id="create-game" class="panel">
    <label>
      Name <input id="player-name" name="name" maxlength="16" autocomplete="nickname" required />
    </label>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Hero</legend>
      <div class="hero-grid" id="hero-grid">
        <label class="hero-card">
          <input type="radio" name="hero" value="warrior" checked />
          <img class="portrait" src={~p"/images/portraits/warrior.png"} alt="" width="80" />
          <strong>Warrior</strong>
          <em>Melee and shield. Chops faster. Kills pay gold.</em>
        </label>
        <label class="hero-card">
          <input type="radio" name="hero" value="mage" />
          <img class="portrait" src={~p"/images/portraits/mage.png"} alt="" width="80" />
          <strong>Mage</strong>
          <em>Fire, frost, and a meteor. A mage tower sharpens spells.</em>
        </label>
        <label class="hero-card">
          <input type="radio" name="hero" value="scout" />
          <img class="portrait" src={~p"/images/portraits/scout.png"} alt="" width="80" />
          <strong>Scout</strong>
          <em>Fast bow. Shows where the next wave breaks the trees.</em>
        </label>
        <label class="hero-card">
          <input type="radio" name="hero" value="farmer" />
          <img class="portrait" src={~p"/images/portraits/farmer.png"} alt="" width="80" />
          <strong>Farmer</strong>
          <em>Plants fields that yield food and gold. Feasts heal the band.</em>
        </label>
        <label class="hero-card">
          <input type="radio" name="hero" value="engineer" />
          <img class="portrait" src={~p"/images/portraits/engineer.png"} alt="" width="80" />
          <strong>Engineer</strong>
          <em>Walls and traps at half the wood. The hammer mends stone.</em>
        </label>
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <button type="submit" id="create-button">Create game</button>
    <p id="create-error" class="error" hidden></p>
    <p class="controls">
      WASD moves. Mouse aims. Click attacks. Q and E are skills. R is the ultimate. Keys 1 to 6 build. F feeds the keep.
    </p>
  </form>

  <section class="panel scores">
    <h2>High scores</h2>
    <ol id="score-list">
      <li class="empty">No keeps have fallen yet.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</main>
